# dead_state_demo.mdp — Phase 3A autopsy demo: dead state detection.
#
# Three states with positive flow (Start, Hall, Goal). Two orphan states
# (Trap1, Trap2) form a self-loop with no escape to anything rewarding.
# The autopsy should detect Trap1 and Trap2 as dead.

STATE: Start
STATE: Hall
STATE: Goal
STATE: Trap1
STATE: Trap2

ACTION: Forward
ACTION: Linger

TRANSITION: Start  Forward Hall   1.0
TRANSITION: Start  Linger  Start  1.0
TRANSITION: Hall   Forward Goal   1.0
TRANSITION: Hall   Linger  Hall   1.0
TRANSITION: Goal   Forward Goal   1.0
TRANSITION: Goal   Linger  Goal   1.0

# The dead pair only cycles among themselves.
TRANSITION: Trap1  Forward Trap2  1.0
TRANSITION: Trap1  Linger  Trap1  1.0
TRANSITION: Trap2  Forward Trap1  1.0
TRANSITION: Trap2  Linger  Trap2  1.0

REWARD: Goal  10.0

DISCOUNT: 0.9
SOLVER:   value_iteration
